* ADVT1 -- Advertiser CRM screen
MAP ADVT1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD HEADER    AT 0,2   LEN 40 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD USERID    AT 0,70  LEN 8  PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD SEARCH    AT 3,20  LEN 30 UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD ADVTID    AT 6,20  LEN 8  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD COMPANY   AT 7,20  LEN 40 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD CONTACT   AT 8,20  LEN 40 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD EMAIL     AT 9,20  LEN 40 PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD AGENCY    AT 10,20 LEN 40 PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD STATF     AT 11,20 LEN 1  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD MESSAGE   AT 14,5  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD FOOTER    AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
